  "job_B8.1.7.2_20251003_114824": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fea inn He w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e ofurnen & he e\u00f0ode swi\u00f0e; b\u00e6d him drincan & heo him bli\u00feelice sealde: behelode hine & he hire cw\u00e6\u00f0 to: Stand nu & beheald: gif her \u00e6nig man cume acsigende embe me, \u00f0onne andswara \u00d0a \u00e6fter litlum fyrste gel\u00e6hte seo wifman an \u00fe\u00e6ra teldsticcena & stop inn digollice, gesloh \u00f0a mid & Barac com sona, sohte \u00feone Sisara; wolde hine ofslean; \u00f0a clipode seo wimman cu\u00f0lice him to, het God \u00fea geeadmette Iabin \u00feone cining \u00e6tforan his folce; & hig f\u00e6stlice weoxon & mid strangre mihte & HI \u00fea feowertig wintra wunedon on sibbe. We secga\u00f0 nu eac \u00fe\u00e6t we singa\u00f0 be \u00feisum on urum sealmsange, swa swa hit sang Dauid \u00feurh \u00feone Hw\u00e6t sind Godes fynd buton \u00fea fulan h\u00e6\u00f0enan & \u00fea leasan Cristenan, \u00fee hlyda\u00f0 ongean God & mid Ac \u00fees sealm us seg\u00f0, hu him sceal getimian, swa swa \u00f0am eorgan Sisaran & \u00feam arleasan Iabine, \u00d0EOS racu us seg\u00f0, \u00fee we nu \u00e6r r\u00e6ddon, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t Israhela folc, \u00fee we embe spreca\u00f0, si\u00fe\u00fean \u00d0a hig miclum geswencton; & heora orf genamon & heora \u00e6ceras aweston & ealle heora bigleofan \u00d0a fleah \u00fe\u00e6t earme folc to fyrlenum muntum & behiddon hig on scr\u00e6fum, mid hungre gew\u00e6hte; \u00f0\u00e6t Israhela folc \u00fea earmlice clipode to \u00feam",
